WEBVTT

9f59ddec6c8b-1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:05.036
In December 1891, James Naismith invented basketball in Springfield.

9f59ddec6c8b-2
00:00:05.385 --> 00:00:08.658
That was four years after he entered the Presbyterian College.

9f59ddec6c8b-3
00:00:08.993 --> 00:00:12.474
He was a Springfield College instructor, and Gulick challenged him.

9f59ddec6c8b-4
00:00:12.869 --> 00:00:14.255
Walk around, if you like.
